old cinema blend this is what he said i  worked so hard to keep it secret that i  was in atlanta shooting all these leaks  were happening and i was like oh my gosh  guys what the hell is going on i'm  working so hard here to stay secret and  then here's an image of me with toby and  they're like no no we're gonna keep it  quiet okay i'll keep denying it now  there are a few photos that are kind of  all the same they're all from the same  scene and to the best of my knowledge  those were really the only photos leaked  that and the one of matt murdock but  there were two photos specifically  leaked of andrew garfield and toby  maguire one was the john campbell photo  that showed the three spider-men and  then there was another one that showed  toby and andrew sitting right next to  each other this was on the statue of  liberty of course and they had the  scaffolding behind them this we now know  because of the statue of liberty being  remodeled to include the captain america  shield which i don't think is going to  happen anymore since it you know kind of  fell but as you can see here these  photos getting out kind of made andrew  garfield mad he did a lot to stay secret  and as we know a ton of people were  asking him about spider-man no way home  there are countless videos out there of  simply fans meeting him at the premieres  of other movies asking him about no way  home he goes on talk shows and jimmy  fallon is sitting there saying we saw a  leaked photo we know you're in the movie  and andrew garfield's saying no i'm not  next thing you know he is on another  talk show saying no i'm not in the film  i'm not the werewolf and get this he  went to such extents to keep this a  secret to keep his cameo and knowing  home a secret that he didn't even tell  emma stone gwen stacy from the amazing  spider-man franchise that he was in the  movie he recently opened up and he said  that emma stone would text him asking if  he was going to be in spiderman no way  home because she heard all of the rumors  and he would reply to her i don't know  what you're talking about i'm not in the  movie so as you can tell andrew garfield  was pretty upset that leaked photos of  him were getting out but what's even  more interesting is sony's response they  said no no we're going to keep quiet  even though there are these leaked  photos out there of you of toby of tom  all together we're going to keep quiet  about it we're not going to confirm  you're in the movie and that was their  marketing strategy moving forward with  spider-man no way home even though all  of these leaks were happening even  though a year before the film came out  people were saying toby maguire and  andrew garfield are returning and  they're going to be in the movie sony  decided and this was their reaction to  it we're not going to say anything ever  we're never going to confirm this we're  not going to show them the trailers  we'll hint at it a little bit just to  get people excited but we're never going  to confirm it and you know what it  worked it created a ton of hype and  excitement and it still made you  question whether or not they were going  to be in the movie even for people like  me who were 99 sure they were going to  be in the film i still had one percent  of doubt because sony never confirmed it  and i went in super excited just not  knowing and it made for a much better  experience now it is unfortunate that  these photos got out and that andrew  garfield did try so hard to remain  secretive but i also think that he did a  pretty good job kind of trying to  convince people that hey this photo's  fake it's photoshopped because let's be  honest there are some really really good  photoshops out there and when he said  it's fake and it's photoshopped a lot of  us thought yeah  maybe it actually could be because  people are really good at photoshops  nowadays but it was real and andrew was  in the film along with toby maguire and  i'm actually surprised only a few photos  were leaked so that's andrew reacting  and sony reacting to the leaks how they  all handled it and i think it was  handled in a pretty decent way but let  me know what you think about it leave  your thoughts down below in the comments  don't forget to like the video and  subscribe to stay up to date on all  things happening in the marvel universe  for live updates you can follow me on  instagram and twitter and as always  thank you all so much for watching woof
 

